{
  "name": "Oldenborn (Ember-Touched): Hearth Dominion",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC%20Button%20Icons/BBTTCC_button_icon_camp.png",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Oldenborn (Ember-Touched)</em> at level 5; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You can make a campfire feel like a cathedral.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Hearth Dominion (1/Long Rest).</strong> Over 1 minute, you sanctify a fire or heat-source. Allies who rest within 30 feet regain an extra Hit Die, and they have advantage on saves against fear until their next long rest.</p>\n        <p><strong>Bad Eden Hook.</strong> Once per Turn, your faction may treat a single “Shelter / Rest” travel step as if the weather were one tier gentler (handled by the Weather engine / GM).</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"hearthDominion\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #c08e6a;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(95,65,45,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e8b890;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Hearth Dominion</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/long rest &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Action (1-minute ritual) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Sanctify a fire/heat-source. Allies who rest within 30 ft regain an extra Hit Die and have advantage vs. fear until their next long rest.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
